WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.460
- This episode of Legal Eagle

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:03.120
was made possible by Skillshare.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.590
Learn to think like a lawyer
